///|
/// The two demonstrations `docs/demo.html` runs, each answered as tab-separated lines the page
/// turns into a table. Everything below is this library's own parsing: a ClientHello goes through
/// `@msg`, the extensions through `@ext`, and the handshake through two `Conn`s that never touch a
/// socket.

///|
/// The certificate and key the walk-through's server presents. Generated by `scripts/gen_tls.py`,
/// the same pair the test suite uses, issued for `a.example` by a root the same script made.
